1
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,000
[Cheetu] Well, well. I guess
you guys were lying in wait for me.

2
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Sorry, but that's gonna backfire on you.

3
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,000
You're gonna die without
ever getting the chance to strike back.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,000
-[Knuckle laughs] Oh, yeah?
-Hmm?

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,000
I barely felt a thing.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:27,000
With a punch like that,

7
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:31,000
you could hit us a few thousand times more
and still not kill us.

8
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:33,000
[laughs]

9
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Okay, I get it.
You're just trying to act tough.

10
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:41,000
[growls]

11
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:43,000
[laughs] The strike's already been called,

12
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:46,000
and you're still swinging. [laughs]

13
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Just a warning. I've been holding back.

14
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,000
I can run faster and punch harder.

15
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:00,000
He actually aimed accurately at my face.

16
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:11,000
[Cheetu] Huh? Him, too?

17
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:15,000
He's tracking where I'm going to be
before he attacks.

18
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:19,000
I've only just encountered them,

19
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:21,000
and they've adjusted to my speed
that quickly?

20
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:26,000
They're nothing like the guys
from yesterday.

21
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:31,000
How fun! Makes it worthwhile
playing with your food.

22
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:34,000
[grunting]

23
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:40,000
[groaning]

24
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:43,000
[opening theme music playing]

25
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:49,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

26
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:29,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

27
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:44,000
[singer singing in English]

28
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:47,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

29
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:08,000
GRUDGE X AND X DREAD

30
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:11,000
[Knuckle and Morel groaning]

31
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:14,000
[Cheetu laughs]
Minds quicker than your bodies?

32
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:18,000
You obviously can't compete physically,
so how are you gonna compensate?

33
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:23,000
[chuckles]

34
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:25,000
With our wits and experience.

35
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:27,000
[exhales]

36
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:30,000
Huh?

37
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:51,000
[laughs]

38
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:53,000
Does that mean
that you're not running away, then?

39
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:56,000
So it's a smoke screen.

40
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:59,000
They'll use it as cover for their attack.

41
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:02,000
Well, let's see what they've got.

42
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:05,000
Here it comes.

43
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:09,000
[gasps]

44
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:19,000
When you're startled,
your whole body freezes up.

45
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:33,000
but even so, I'm perfectly fine.

46
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:36,000
Huh?

47
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:39,000
What the hell is this?

48
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:59,000
Well, it looks like your anger
is binding you to your surroundings,

49
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:04,000
[growls]

50
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:08,000
Shut up!

51
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:13,000
They're gone.

52
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:14,000
Where did you go?

53
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:18,000
[A.P.R.] It is time.
You have accrued interest.

54
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:21,000
[growls]

55
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:25,000
[scoffs] It doesn't matter
what your power does.

56
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:28,000
I just have to leave you in my dust.

57
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:39,000
[Morel] It looks like
he's powerless against Zetsu.

58
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:52,000
We'll just chase him down,
box him in, and that'll be the end of it.

59
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:57,000
But doesn't your ability lose its effect
if the target moves too far away?

60
00:05:57,000 --> 00:06:01,000
Well, sure, it'll stop accruing interest,
but it won't disappear.

61
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:10,000
Best part is, we won't even
need to change it to IRS.

62
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:12,000
We've already seen what he can do.

63
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:13,000
You damn fool!

64
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:15,000
Just because we know his pitches

65
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:25,000
Yeah, you're right.

66
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:37,000
Damn. I can't shake this stupid thing.

67
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:42,000
it must be Nen.

68
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:46,000
I'm gonna need a lot more
than just speed here.

69
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:57,000
[soft crackling]

70
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:05,000
[crackling continues]

71
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:12,000
[Shoot] Kite is inside this cage,

72
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:15,000
but he's no longer
the person you once knew.

73
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:17,000
It's okay.

74
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:20,000
We're gonna find a way
to cure him somehow.

75
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:26,000
[Shoot] Hotel Rafflesia.

76
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:31,000
Once I deal a certain amount of damage
to my enemy,

77
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:33,000
the cage traps them inside,

78
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:37,000
-either whole or just a part.
-[gasps]

79
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:42,000
[Killua] So that's how he took my eye.

80
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:46,000
[gasps]

81
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:10,000
Be careful.

82
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:16,000
He can't use Nen,
but he's still as strong as ever.

83
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:48,000
[breath shaking]

84
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:53,000
[Gon] Kite.

85
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:08,000
He mechanically attacks anything
that gets close to him.

86
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:37,000
[gasps]

87
00:09:59,000 --> 00:10:00,000
You haven't hit me since…

88
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:04,000
since the day we first met.

89
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:28,000
[growls]

90
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:32,000
Well? Are you gonna let this continue?

91
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:35,000
Gon can't defend himself
with Nen either, right?

92
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:37,000
It'll be fine.

93
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:39,000
Gon is bound to notice.

94
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:43,000
In fact, he might have
figured it out already,

95
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:44,000
if we're lucky.

96
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:46,000
[Knov] Perhaps…

97
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:50,000
he's suppressing his reflexes
to dodge or block,

98
00:11:02,000 --> 00:11:05,000
but Gon shouldn't be able to adapt
so quickly in his condition.

99
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:12,000
[Killua] He just doesn't know
what else to do. I'm sure of it.

100
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:21,000
[blows landing]

101
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:23,000
[Gon] He'll go right next.

102
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:46,000
His punches hurt more than this,
a lot more!

103
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:49,000
[both gasp]

104
00:12:14,000 --> 00:12:16,000
You can leave everything to us.

105
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:25,000
[gasps]

106
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:26,000
[gasps]

107
00:12:33,000 --> 00:12:37,000
Gon can't see that thing, but it activates
whenever someone touches Kite.

108
00:12:38,000 --> 00:12:43,000
You're gonna need some seriously advanced
fighting skills to defeat him now.

109
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:48,000
My ability sealed Kite's Nen,
but that thing right there

110
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:10,000
I'm sorry. We had no other choice.

111
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:13,000
If you keep away, he won't attack.

112
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:18,000
[breath trembling]

113
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:37,000
I'll fix you. I promise.

114
00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:03,000
[door closes]

115
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:06,000
Killua…

116
00:14:07,000 --> 00:14:09,000
I could tell that something was different.

117
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:11,000
What did you two do?

118
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:14,000
You changed so much in such a short time.

119
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:18,000
We didn't do anything.

120
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:22,000
They're the ones who changed us.

121
00:14:26,000 --> 00:14:28,000
A FEW WEEKS LATER

122
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:39,000
[Morel] So what do you think?
Was it right to let them tag along?

123
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:43,000
We'll be breaking our promise
to the old man, you know.

124
00:14:43,000 --> 00:14:45,000
It's not a problem.

125
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:49,000
The test was only intended to determine
who would and would not enter the NGL.

126
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:53,000
And we are, at the moment,
headed to the Republic of East Gorteau.

127
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:54,000
Isn't that correct?

128
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:58,000
Sure sounds like
you're splitting hairs to me.

129
00:14:58,000 --> 00:15:01,000
You're not suggesting
we take them back, are you?

130
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:04,000
[Morel] No.
Those two are full-grown tigers now,

131
00:15:05,000 --> 00:15:10,000
and the best thing about full-grown tigers
is they can take care of themselves.

132
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:14,000
Well, Killua is capable.
Do you think Gon is too?

133
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:19,000
I must admit I was impressed
by the way he moved back there,

134
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:23,000
but I can't say
I've seen him show any fire since then.

135
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:28,000
He's improved with training,
but he clearly lacks any real focus.

136
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:33,000
He's inconsistent.
His power levels can vary widely.

137
00:15:33,000 --> 00:15:37,000
Maybe so, but at least
he's consistently inconsistent.

138
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:41,000
He doesn't take things too seriously
unless he has to.

139
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:47,000
I feel his lack of motivation
is like a coiled up spring.

140
00:15:54,000 --> 00:15:56,000
he hates enough to unleash it on.

141
00:15:57,000 --> 00:15:59,000
Well, we'll see soon enough.

142
00:16:01,000 --> 00:16:04,000
Gon's Nen will be back tomorrow,
just in time,

143
00:16:04,000 --> 00:16:06,000
and the enemy's straight ahead.

144
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:26,000
Diego has personally invited
all the citizens in the country

145
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:28,000
to the capital city of Peijing

146
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:44,000
where practically every citizen,

147
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:46,000
from infants to the infirm,

148
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:50,000
have all been summoned for a celebration
spanning three whole days.

149
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:54,000
I believe it's rather safe to assume
that this time around,

150
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:05,000
But if he announced his successor
and abdication simultaneously,

151
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:07,000
it would send a very powerful message.

152
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:10,000
Still, I find it hard to imagine

153
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:22,000
[announcer] Well, whatever it is,

154
00:17:22,000 --> 00:17:25,000
in ten short days,
the whole world will be watching.

155
00:17:25,000 --> 00:17:28,000
-In other news…
-Colt has a theory.

156
00:17:28,000 --> 00:17:32,000
He believes that the celebration
will be used to sort the population.

157
00:17:37,000 --> 00:17:41,000
but 99% of the humans that are there now
will most certainly die.

158
00:17:42,000 --> 00:17:44,000
But we cannot let that happen.

159
00:17:45,000 --> 00:17:47,000
We have ten days.

160
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:50,000
The old man, what's he up to right now?

161
00:17:51,000 --> 00:17:53,000
He sent me a text a little while ago

162
00:17:53,000 --> 00:17:56,000
saying he's already infiltrated
East Gorteau.

163
00:17:56,000 --> 00:17:58,000
I haven't heard a word from him
since then.

164
00:17:58,000 --> 00:18:01,000
[Killua] So do you think
he's been taken out?

165
00:18:02,000 --> 00:18:06,000
[Knov] Before he left, he told us
that if we don't hear from him today,

166
00:18:06,000 --> 00:18:08,000
we're to assume the worst has happened.

167
00:18:10,000 --> 00:18:12,000
-[cell phone rings]
-[all gasp]

168
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:23,000
[Morel] That old man's
got some satellites for ears.

169
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:35,000
[Netero] I want you
to split into three pairs

170
00:18:35,000 --> 00:18:38,000
and lure the Royal Guards
away from the King.

171
00:18:38,000 --> 00:18:41,000
Start at midnight
the night before the rally.

172
00:18:42,000 --> 00:18:44,000
From the Old Man With Satellite Ears.

173
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:48,000
That old bastard
scares the crap out of me.

174
00:18:56,000 --> 00:18:58,000
the 30 days are up meow,

175
00:18:58,000 --> 00:19:01,000
and that means
it's time for me to be moving on.

176
00:19:01,000 --> 00:19:02,000
So see you later.

177
00:19:02,000 --> 00:19:03,000
[laughs]

178
00:19:05,000 --> 00:19:06,000
[gasps]

179
00:19:09,000 --> 00:19:12,000
Well, all right.
It looks like you can use Nen again.

180
00:19:44,000 --> 00:19:48,000
Gon, don't hold back.
Show him your Jajanken.

181
00:19:53,000 --> 00:19:54,000
[Gon] A real attack?

182
00:19:55,000 --> 00:19:56,000
Yes, damn it!

183
00:19:56,000 --> 00:20:00,000
Give me everything you've got,
or you're off the team.

184
00:20:01,000 --> 00:20:02,000
[Gon] Got it.

185
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:32,000
[gasps]

186
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:42,000
Show me rock!

187
00:20:52,000 --> 00:20:53,000
[breathing heavily]

188
00:20:58,000 --> 00:20:59,000
[breath trembling]

189
00:21:01,000 --> 00:21:02,000
Gon…

190
00:21:04,000 --> 00:21:05,000
that's enough.

191
00:21:14,000 --> 00:21:15,000
[gasps]

192
00:21:16,000 --> 00:21:17,000
Killua! Thanks a lot.

193
00:21:17,000 --> 00:21:19,000
Uh, sorry, Mr. Morel.

194
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:22,000
I really was just about to kill you.

195
00:21:22,000 --> 00:21:23,000
[gasps]

196
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:32,000
You got me real good there, kid.

197
00:21:32,000 --> 00:21:35,000
And you've got just about
the right amount of crazy in you too.

198
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:38,000
Okay, we'll split up now.

199
00:21:39,000 --> 00:21:42,000
Go and fulfill your mission
by any means necessary.

200
00:21:53,000 --> 00:21:55,000
Knov and I will take Shaiapouf.

201
00:21:56,000 --> 00:21:57,000
Best of luck out there.

202
00:22:01,000 --> 00:22:04,000
[narrator] The preparations
for the final battle are complete at last.

203
00:23:34,000 --> 00:23:36,000
[Gon] Next time, "A Lawless Home."

204
00:23:36,000 --> 00:23:38,000
-[Killua] Wanna get controlled?
-[Gon] Huh?

205
00:23:38,000 --> 00:23:40,000
[Killua] Stick this antenna here.

206
00:23:40,000 --> 00:23:42,000
[Gon] Huh? It just has to be Killua.
